00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
How to wash the cow dung

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Before this, creating the cow dung water washing effect has always been a very complicated process.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
But with our new design, you can achieve this effect faster and more easily.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
To turn on the water washing effect, please first select the fabric to apply the effect.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Then, under the type selection, switch the fabric from matte to cow dung.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Under the default setting, it is set to non-water washing.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
But you can choose any water washing type and start to define yourself.

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,000
In this example, I will choose acid washing.

9
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
As you can see, the water washing effect has been successfully applied.

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Now we can use some parameters to adjust the results.

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
The first is acid concentration.

12
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
This is the only setting that changes according to the water washing type.

13
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
It controls the strength or opacity of the water washing sticker.

14
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
You can also adjust the mixing mode.

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Here I choose the stacking mode.

16
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,000
The absorption increases the blur or spread effect for the sticker.

17
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
It mimics the way the water wash is absorbed into the plant.

18
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
The cycle cycle can increase the brightness of the water wash.

19
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:18,000
The longer the water wash cycle is imitated, the brighter the surface effect is obtained.

20
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Finally, the cow dung dung dung can strengthen the wrinkle texture of the clothes.

21
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
You can try this effect at will.

22
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,000
These values have reached the appearance you want.

23
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Click on the water washing technique type, water washing pattern.

24
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:36,000
You can set the shrink, rotate, and balance of the water washing pattern.

25
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:40,000
You can enter specific values here to complete the adjustment.

26
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,000
As mentioned above, if you switch to a different water washing type,

27
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:53,000
you will see that the acid concentration has become another setting.

28
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,000
They have similar functions.

29
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:00,000
You can set other water washing settings to increase the authenticity of your work.

30
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,000
That's all for this video.

31
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,000
